<figure class="text-figure" data-ranking aria-labelledby="ranking-title">
  <figcaption id="ranking-title"><span class="figure-number">Figure 4</span> Choose two results which can be bought</figcaption>
  <label class="figure-option">Limit placement <select data-order aria-label="Limit placement"><option value="correct">After the stock filter</option><option value="early">Before the stock filter</option></select></label>
  <p class="representation">Request: blue OR tea · return up to 2 in-stock products</p>
  <div class="rank-rows" data-live>
    <div data-product="P3"><strong>P3</strong><span>Green tea, 50 g <small>stock 10</small></span><span class="rank-bar"><i style="--rank-size:91.67%"></i></span><span>1.1</span><b data-state="P3">match</b></div>
    <div data-product="P7"><strong>P7</strong><span>Blue mug <small>stock 0</small></span><span class="rank-bar"><i style="--rank-size:100%"></i></span><span>1.2</span><b data-state="P7">match</b></div>
    <div data-product="P9"><strong>P9</strong><span>Teapot <small>stock 4</small></span><span class="rank-bar"><i style="--rank-size:16.67%"></i></span><span>0.2</span><b data-state="P9">match</b></div>
  </div>
  <p class="query-check" data-output data-live>3 text matches</p>
  <p class="step-explanation" data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">All three products match. P7 has the largest text score, but no stock.</p>
  <div class="player" role="group" aria-label="Figure 4 playback"><button type="button" data-play>Play</button><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step>1 / 4</span></div><div class="hold" data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
  <p class="figure-note">Scores are checked <code>ts_rank_cd(search, query)</code> results with default weights and no length normalisation. This is the logical selection order; PostgreSQL may arrange execution work differently.</p>
  <details><summary>All stages, as text</summary><p>Correct selection: all three match; stock excludes P7; ranking orders P3 (1.1), P9 (0.2); the limit returns both. Limiting first chooses P7 (1.2) and P3 (1.1), then stock removes P7. Only P3 remains, although P9 was eligible.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
import {stepper} from '../figures/stepper.mjs';
for(const root of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-ranking]')){
 const order=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-order]')!;
 const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>4,draw(step:number){
  const early=order.value==='early';
  const ids=step===0?['P3','P7','P9']:early?['P7','P3','P9']:step===1?['P3','P7','P9']:['P3','P9','P7'];
  for(const id of ids){
    const row=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-product="${id}"]`)!;row.parentElement!.appendChild(row);
    const removed=early?(step>=2&&id==='P9')||(step===3&&id==='P7'):step>=1&&id==='P7';
    row.classList.toggle('rejected',removed);
    root.querySelector(`[data-state="${id}"]`)!.textContent=removed?(id==='P7'?'out of stock':'outside limit'):step===3?'returned':'match';
  }
  const correct=['All three products match. P7 has the largest text score, but no stock.','Apply stock > 0. P7 is ineligible however well its words match.','Order the eligible rows by descending score, then product ID for any ties. P3 precedes P9.','Take up to two. P3 and P9 both reach the result.'];
  const wrong=['All three products match. P7 has the largest text score, but no stock.','Rank every text match. P7 leads, then P3, then P9.','An early LIMIT 2 keeps P7 and P3. P9 has already been discarded.','Now stock removes P7. Only P3 remains. A later filter cannot recover P9.'];
  root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=(early?wrong:correct)[step];
  root.querySelector('[data-output]')!.textContent=step===3?(early?'Result: P3 · one eligible product lost':'Result: P3, P9 · both eligible products'):(step===0?'3 text matches':early?'Ranked matches → early limit → stock':'Text matches → stock → rank → limit');
 }});order.addEventListener('change',()=>player.render());
}
</script>
